
---

## `.cursorignore`

```gitignore
# Dependencies
node_modules/
vendor/

# Build output
public/build/
dist/
build/

# Local environment files
.env
.env.*
*.local

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Archives and database dumps
*.sql
*.sqlite
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.gz

# WordPress sensitive files
wp-config.php
wp-config-local.php

# WordPress uploads and generated content
wp-content/uploads/
wp-content/cache/
wp-content/upgrade/
wp-content/backup*/

# Local app and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE noise
.idea/
.vscode/

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
.cache/